n: 9.5.20
kind: hub
name: review-of-hash-measurement
is: All 38 claims of 3.15.kg (21 observations, 17 findings) were read against their sources: 31 confirmed, 7 amended (3.15.2.1, 3.15.3.7, 3.15.4.4, 3.15.5.3, 3.15.8.4, 3.15.8.5, 3.15.9.4), none disputed, none left unreviewed; the file has no web-relayed node. The study report was read whole, its ten programs and twelve raw output files were opened in the session scratch directory and compared with the report's appendix, the old body's files and the first-round reports were opened at the cited lines, and the arithmetic was recomputed.
